Source: colnames
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/theory/colnames

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-colnames
Architecture: any
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Return the column names of a PostgreSQL record
 colnames(record) returns the column names of a composite value as a name array.
 It supports generic triggers and dynamic SQL without additional dependencies.
